:: Island Wolf
<<if $molestationstart is 1>>
	<<set $molestationstart to 0>>
	<<controlloss>>
	<<violence 1>>
	<<neutral 1>>
	<<molested>>
	<<beastCombatInit>>
	<<set $enemytrust -= 40>>
<</if>>

<<effects>>
<<effectsman>>

<br>
<<beast $enemyno>>
<br><br>

<<stateman>>
<br><br>
<<actionsman>>

<<if _combatend>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Island Wolf Finish]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<<else>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Island Wolf]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<</if>>

:: Island Wolf Finish

<<if $enemyarousal gte $enemyarousalmax>>
	<<beastejaculation>>

	The <<beasttype>> grunts in satisfaction, and leaves you lying between the trees.
	<br><br>

	<<tearful>> you rise to your feet.
	<br><br>

	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>

	<<link [[Next|Island]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif $enemyhealth lte 0>>
	The <<beasttype>> yelps and flees into the forest.
	<br><br>

	<<tearful>> you gather yourself.
	<br><br>

	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>

	<<link [[Next|Island]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	The <<beasttype>> yelps and flees into the forest.
	<br><br>

	<<tearful>> you gather yourself.
	<br><br>

	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>

	<<link [[Next|Island]]>><</link>>
	<br>	
<</if>>

:: Island Ant
<<if $molestationstart is 1>>
	<<set $molestationstart to 0>>
	<<controlloss>>
	<<violence 1>>
	<<neutral 1>>
	<<molested>>
	<<beastCombatInit>>
	<<set $enemytrust -= 40>>
<</if>>

<<effects>>
<<effectsman>>

<br>
<<beast $enemyno>>
<br><br>

<<stateman>>
<br><br>
<<actionsman>>

<<if _combatend>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Island Ant Finish]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<<else>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Island Ant]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<</if>>

:: Island Ant Finish

<<if $enemyarousal gte $enemyarousalmax>>
	<<beastejaculation>>

	The <<beasttype>> clicks in satisfaction, and leaves you lying in the sand.
	<br><br>

	<<tearful>> you rise to your feet.
	<br><br>

	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>

	<<link [[Next|Island]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif $enemyhealth lte 0>>
	The <<beasttype>> screeches and digs into the sand.
	<br><br>

	<<tearful>> you gather yourself.
	<br><br>

	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>

	<<link [[Next|Island]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	The <<beasttype>> screeches and digs into the sand.
	<br><br>

	<<tearful>> you gather yourself.
	<br><br>

	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>

	<<link [[Next|Island]]>><</link>>
	<br>	
<</if>>

:: Island Rape
You wake up under assault by a beast 
<br><br>
<<if $islanddistance lt 30>>
	<<beastNEWinit 1 ant>>
	<!-- Modified for monster people -->
	A lone <<beasttype>> emerges from the sand, gnashing its teeth.
	<<if $monster is 1>>
		"Invader," <<bhe>> cackles. "Mine."
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Island Ant]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif $islanddistance lte 70>>
    <<beastNEWinit 1 wolf>>
	<!-- Modified for monster people -->
	A lone <<beasttype>> emerges from between the trees, teeth bared.
	<<if $monster is 1>>
		"Found you," <<bhe>> barks. "Mine."
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Island Wolf]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	<<beastNEWinit 1 bear>>
	<!-- Modified for monster people -->
	A lone <<beasttype>> emerges from the snow, teeth bared.
	<<if $monster is 1>>
		"Food," <<bhe>> cackles.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Island Bear]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Island Struggle
<<effects>>

<<if $struggle_start is 1>>
    <<struggle_init>>
	<<set $struggle.creature to "lurker">>
	<<struggle_creatures 1 1>>
	<<set $combat to 1>>
	<<controlloss>>
	<<violence 1>>
	<<molested>>
	<<set $struggle.mouth.creature to "lurker">>
	<<set $mouthuse to "struggle">><<set $mouthstate to "struggle">><<set $struggle.enemy[0].location to "mouth">>
	<<unset $struggle_start>>
<</if>>

<<struggle>>

<<if $struggle.done gte $struggle.number>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Island Struggle Finish]]>><</link>></span>
	<br>
<<else>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Island Struggle]]>><</link>></span>
	<br>
<</if>>


:: Island Struggle Finish
<<effects>>

The creature darts into a bush before you can get a good look at it.
<br><br>

<<clotheson>>
<<endcombat>>

<<link [[Next|Island]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Island Bear
<<if $molestationstart is 1>>
	<<set $molestationstart to 0>>
	<<controlloss>>
	<<violence 1>>
	<<neutral 1>>
	<<molested>>

	<<beastCombatInit>><<set $enemytrust -= 40>><<set $enemyanger += 40>><<set $enemyhealthmax to 400>><<set $enemyhealth to 400>><<set $enemyarousalmax to 1000>>
	<br><br>
<</if>>

<<effects>>
<<effectsman>>

<br>
<<beast $enemyno>>
<br><br>
<<stateman>>
<br><br>
<<actionsman>>

<<if _combatend>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Island Bear Finish]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<<else>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Island Bear]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<</if>>

:: Island Bear Finish

<<effects>>

<<if $enemyarousal gte $enemyarousalmax>>
	<<beastejaculation>>

	Satisfied, the <<beasttype>> returns to its abode.
	<<if $monster is 1>>
		"Next time I might take you with me, squishy," <<bhe>> coos.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<tearful>> you continue on your way.
	<br><br>

	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>

	<<link [[Next|Island]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif $enemyhealth lte 0>>
	You scare the mighty <<beasttype>>. <<bHe>> flees deeper into the forest.
	<<if $monster is 1>>
		"Not so tiny! Not so squishy!" <<bhe>> yells as <<bhe>> runs.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<tearful>> you continue on your way.
	<br><br>

	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>

	<<link [[Next|Island]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	The <<beasttype>> yelps and flees through the snow.
	<br><br>

	<<tearful>> you gather yourself.
	<br><br>

	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>

	<<link [[Next|Island]]>><</link>>
	<br>	
<</if>>